@TobiGr You forgot the notification update settings. I also think we should group the update notification setting, the playback notification settings and the new streams notification settings in a global setting page, like you said. However, I also think we should add a link which starts the app notifications settings in Android settings (only "officially" available in Oreo and available in Nougat, if I am not wrong; in lower Android versions, we should start the app's info page from Android settings).

This has an advantage: show the real notification settings for some ROMs, like EMUI (at least on the 10 version, when using the notification settings in the app info, it opens the System Manager which has a pretty bad notifications management (no notifications priorities especially, no mean to hide a notification from the notification bar at the top of your screen (the lowset priority from Android notifications))). If you want screenshots between the two notifications management pages, free feel to you to ask me.

(I hope I was understood, sorry for my English.)

